  - observability
  - visualization
  - three-js
abstract: >-
  A live, local-only isometric 3D office in which Claude Code sessions,
  agent-team teammates and subagents appear as people at work. It shows what
  each agent is doing, its memory and token use, a shared mission board of
  tasks, who needs the human's attention, and a replay of the day, with zero
  token overhead.
